  "title": "J-Long Group Limited Announces Pricing of its Initial Public Offering",
  "summary": "HONG KONG, Jan. 23, 2024 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — J-Long Group Limited (Nasdaq: JL) (the“Company” or “J-Long”), an established distributor in Hong Kong of reflective and non-reflective garment trims, today announced the pricing of its initial public offering (the“Offering”) of 1,400,000 ordinary shares at a public offering price of $5.00 per ordinary share. The Company expects […]",
